// Instrument Sans Bold (so it can't drift from the page font) and scaled so its
// x-height (510 units) equals the badge height (720): the letter tops, the badge top
// and the shared baseline all line up exactly.
// Colours come from the theme: --accent / --on-accent for the badge, currentColor for the text.
